{"type":"standard","title":"Komi language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Komi language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q36126","titles":{"canonical":"Komi_language","normalized":"Komi language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Komi language</span></span>"},"pageid":986058,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/3LangHotel.JPG/330px-3LangHotel.JPG","width":330,"height":440},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/49/3LangHotel.JPG","width":1704,"height":2272},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1353671080","tid":"fbafd904-4d60-11f1-af45-2621bfa1c401","timestamp":"2026-05-11T17:43:56Z","description":"Uralic language spoken in Russia","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Komi_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Komi_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Komi_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Komi_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Komi_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Komi_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Komi_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Komi_language"}},"extract":"Komi, also known as Zyran, Zyrian or Komi-Zyryan, is the native language of the Komi (Zyrians). It is one of the Permic languages; the other regional varieties are Komi-Permyak, which has official status, and Komi-Yazva.","extract_html":"<p><b>Komi</b>, also known as <b>Zyran</b>, <b>Zyrian</b> or <b>Komi-Zyryan</b>, is the native language of the Komi (Zyrians). It is one of the Permic languages; the other regional varieties are Komi-Permyak, which has official status, and Komi-Yazva.</p>"}